ng data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"855\">Losse cartridge (zonder doosje)</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1dic7ne\" data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<p data-start=\"860\" data-end=\"889\">Contactpunten schoongemaakt</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"5rcojp\" data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"920\">\r\n<p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"920\">Getest en volledig werkend</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"937\"><strong data-start=\"922\" data-end=\"937\">🛡 Garantie</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1027\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Bij aankoop ontvang je <strong data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"974\">garantie</strong> op het product. Zo kun je met een gerust hart gamen.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
